; SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
;
; incremental — internal/execute/incremental: the incremental program over the
; driver's program (program.go), its snapshot (snapshot.go, programtosnapshot.go),
; the affected-files and emit-files handlers, and the build info in both
; directions (buildInfo.go, snapshottobuildinfo.go, buildinfotosnapshot.go,
; referencemap.go, incremental.go).
;
; ★ The reference's SyncMaps keyed by tspath.Path are PathMaps here: a key list,
; a value list and a live bit, scanned linearly. The work groups run their tasks
; one after another in the program's file order; where the reference's result is
; independent of the order (a set, a sorted listing) nothing observable moves, and
; where it is not — the order files are written in — the program's file order is
; the deterministic choice a single-threaded run makes.
;
; ★ A diagnostic is a DriverDiagnostic (the checker's facts plus its file) or,
; when it came from a build info, an IncBuildInfoDiagnostic that is converted on
; first use, exactly as DiagnosticsOrBuildInfoDiagnosticsWithFileName converts.

